Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.71,0:00:10.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you for your business!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.16,0:00:12.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I hope to hear from you again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.23,0:00:14.91,Default,Customer,0,0,0,,Sorry to always make you come out this far.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.91,0:00:17.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Not at all! I'm more than happy to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:19.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well then, please excuse me.
