Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.48,0:01:30.63,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.63,0:01:31.58,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Oh my.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.58,0:01:34.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Have you been waiting long?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.03,0:01:35.96,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,I just got here, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.44,0:01:40.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll open up right away. \NMay I take your garments first?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.67,0:01:41.85,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Sure, sure.
