Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.50,0:01:48.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll be with you in a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.51,0:01:54.39,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, it must be so hard \Nfor you working alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.39,0:01:57.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,No, not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.14,0:02:00.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I can manage the amount of business I get now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.23,0:02:04.89,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But when pickups and deliveries\N pile up on the weekend, like today,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.89,0:02:06.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,things can get just a little busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.93,0:02:10.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you for your patience.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.78,0:02:13.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Please allow me to inspect your garments.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\fs32\frz15.36\pos(306,21)\c&H874B45&\3c&HF5F5F5&\bord3}Collection Receipt
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\fs27\c&H874B45&\3c&HF5F5F5&\bord3\frz17.23\pos(139,179)}Location
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\fs27\c&H874B45&\3c&HF5F5F5&\bord3\pos(150,262)\frz19.1}Name
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.29,0:02:22.54,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\fs22\c&H874B45&\3c&HF5F5F5&\bord3\pos(195,318)\frz18.77}Date Received
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:36.68,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,I got that stain about a week ago. \NI tried scrubbing, but it wouldn't come out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.08,0:02:39.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So this is a week old?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.97,0:02:42.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Can you tell me what caused the stain?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.41,0:02:45.56,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,It was a pasta sauce with tomatoes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.47,0:02:51.19,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Do you think the stain will come out?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.83,0:02:56.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.95,0:03:00.89,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,I'll leave you to it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:02.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.95,0:03:06.96,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H8FC3C9&\3c&H8D7A57&\fad(1,441)}Kinme Cleaning
