Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.12,0:05:46.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Welcome!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.71,0:05:50.12,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Okay, let me guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.40,0:05:51.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.56,0:05:53.80,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I'd bet you're in the mood
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:58.05,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,to eat something sweet!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.05,0:05:58.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.90,0:06:02.78,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Yagara-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.78,0:06:05.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This is just what I needed!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.17,0:06:07.40,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,My husband picked them up on a business trip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.29,0:06:10.66,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'll make tea, so will you join me?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.66,0:06:13.79,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,No, no. I have to head straight back.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.04,0:06:16.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Okay, let me grab your garments for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.47,0:06:20.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Did you ride your bicycle here again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.69,0:06:22.57,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Hmm? Sure did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.57,0:06:24.82,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That's really impressive, \Nconsidering all the hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:24.82,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H323839&\3c&H77AD8F&\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman}Thank You for Choosing Us\N{\fnArial\b1}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.82,0:06:29.08,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Thanks for saying so. \NI'm bikin' around Atami and buildin' muscle!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.58,0:06:34.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A suit jacket with pants and five dress shirts. \NDoes that sound right?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.47,0:06:35.87,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm! Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:39.16,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Listen to what my husband said.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.16,0:06:41.58,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,He told me that ever since \Nwe've started coming here,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:43.97,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,his suits have gotten \Nmuch more comfortable to wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:49.22,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh? I'm so glad! \NI wash all shirts and suits in water here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.58,0:06:52.72,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh? Don't you have to dry clean suits?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.72,0:06:56.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Dry cleaning is definitely more common.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.71,0:07:03.67,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This is, well, something of a trade secret...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:04.42,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.42,0:07:11.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I put each piece in a double mesh laundry bag\N and wash them separately in cold water.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.32,0:07:14.75,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Then I hang them to dry overnight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.75,0:07:18.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The next morning, \Na very quick spin in the dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:20.53,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,As soon as the fabric starts to fluff up,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.88,0:07:24.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I give them a very thorough ironing.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.08,0:07:29.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Front and back, straightening out \Nthe seams, very, very carefully.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.75,0:07:34.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So it should make them very comfortable!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.13,0:07:36.39,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,No kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.82,0:07:39.31,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,You sure do love doing laundry, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.27,0:07:44.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, I think I do!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.58,0:07:50.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It is the one thing I didn't forget, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.96,0:07:55.42,Default,Yagara,0,0,0,,I'll see you around, Kinme-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.42,0:07:57.24,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.49,0:08:09.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, look at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.55,0:08:09.67,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\frz248.1\shad0\c&H5A6D8D&\3c&HB0C4DA&\fs27\pos(224,182)\frx10\fry334}Closed for the Day
