Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs10\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\pos(214,202)\c&H49656C&\3c&H7CB0BD&}Men's Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.31,0:08:22.81,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs8\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\c&H49656C&\3c&H7CB8C7&\pos(413.286,202)}Women's Bath\h\h\h\hWomen's Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.03,0:08:29.16,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Well, hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.16,0:08:30.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good evening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.58,0:08:32.45,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Thanks for your help today.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.45,0:08:36.10,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I was able to remove the stain on your blouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.10,0:08:39.21,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,You were? That's actually one of my favorites.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.21,0:08:40.99,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Thank you, dear!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.99,0:08:41.86,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:56.18,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\fs17\shad0\c&H778A95&\3c&HF5F2F1&\b1\}Be sure to turn off the hot water
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.59,0:08:54.55,Default,Regular,0,0,0,,Well, I'm off. Have a good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.55,0:08:56.18,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good night.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.05,0:09:02.47,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Just another day's work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:10.56,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\c&H49656C&\3c&H8DB5BF&\frz319\fax0.26\pos(240,210)}Women's Bath
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.45,0:09:15.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fs20\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\c&H49656C&\3c&H8DB5BF&\frz319\fax0.26\pos(342,299)}Women's Bath
Dialogue: 1,0:09:11.30,0:09:13.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good night, ma'am!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:13.59,0:09:15.95,Default,Ma'am,0,0,0,,Yes, good night! See you soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.72,0:09:35.47,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,Oh, that's right. It was today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.31,0:09:44.88,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,No wonder there are so many \Npeople out and about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.72,0:09:53.76,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,In that case, maybe I'll do \Njust a little more work
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.34,0:09:58.86,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,with this playing in the background.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.00,0:10:07.00,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(90,254)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.00,0:10:12.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnTimesNewRoman\shad0\fs22\c&HC4C480&\3c&HFBFFFE&\an7\frz9.132\pos(419,24)}Wash {\c&0000000&}It All Away
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.51,0:10:18.51,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\b1\fnArial\shad0\c&H4AB6B8&\3c&H4C4A46&}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.37,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\pos(448,49)\b1\c&HCEC0B7&\3c&H9A501C&\shad0}Gift Shop
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.12,0:10:40.37,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\b1\c&HDCCCC2&\3c&H9A501C&\fs17\pos(203,94)\shad0}Atsuei Dried Fish Store
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.31,0:11:11.11,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,Oh, it's Kinme-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.11,0:11:14.37,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,G'morning! You sure are up early.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.37,0:11:15.98,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,Do you have the day off?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.98,0:11:21.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ah, no. A little exercise \Nbefore opening helps me wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.31,0:11:24.96,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,You don't say. So you're all \Nbright-eyed and bushy-tailed now?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.30,0:11:28.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, I'm still not much of a morning person.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.58,0:11:34.14,Default,Regular 2,0,0,0,,I never would have guessed. \NYou always seem to have your act together.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.14,0:11:35.59,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.59,0:11:37.20,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Do you mean it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.20,0:11:42.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Aww, look at you. There, there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.23,0:11:50.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, I should get going. See you later!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.15,0:11:51.21,Default,Regular 3,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.65,0:12:01.28,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fs24\an8\fnArial\c&H6E675B&\3c&HF7EEDF&}Homestyle Inn Ishimochi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.02,0:12:00.66,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I wonder if that's the innkeeper's son.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.28,0:12:03.91,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,I think he's supposed to be in high school.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.91,0:12:06.16,Italics,Kinme (M),0,0,0,,How responsible of him to be helping so early.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.75,0:12:21.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! I'd better head back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.21,0:12:29.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.81,0:12:32.06,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Good morning, Poly-chan.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.70,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\frx8\fry340\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&\fs30\frz3.405\pos(282,112)}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.58,0:12:47.16,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,Another busy day.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.70,0:12:48.88,Italics,Kinme,0,0,0,,Let's get to it!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.39,0:13:08.60,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.60,0:13:12.31,Default,Regular 4,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, I've brought \Nsome more things for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.31,0:13:15.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure! Let me see what we have here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.11,0:13:20.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. Didn't you bring me this one before?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.94,0:13:23.07,Default,Regular 4,0,0,0,,Yes, just once.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.07,0:13:25.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I think I remember the fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:28.37,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(793,1)\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\fs18\frz359.4\pos(339,17)}Orders will be ready
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.97,0:13:28.37,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(793,1)\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\fs18\frz359.4\pos(398,64)}on the {\c&H3030A0&\b1\fs26}16th
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:43.28,Default,Regular 5,0,0,0,,Kinme-san, I'm here to pick up the item I left.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.28,0:13:46.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in. May I see your receipt?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.50,0:13:47.26,Default,Regular 5,0,0,0,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.23,0:13:54.15,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Is this the right one?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.15,0:13:54.77,Default,Regular 5,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.71,0:13:57.45,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.45,0:13:58.73,Default,Regular 5,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.28,0:14:01.31,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.03,0:14:10.23,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Hello, this is Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.60,0:14:15.42,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,A pickup at 4 PM tomorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:18.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,310)\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\fs20\frz19.19\pos(225,146)}Tomorrow
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:18.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,310)\bord0\shad0\c&H46464C&\fnArial\fs20\pos(317,243)\frz22.26}4 PM
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.42,0:14:16.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes, that's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.50,0:14:17.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,{\fad(1,249)}Can I have your address...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.69,0:14:36.19,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&\fs27\an8\frz6.011\pos(284,40)}Away for a moment. \N{\fnVerdana\shad0\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&}Be back soon. - Owner
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.94,0:14:41.94,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\frz6.687\shad0\b1\fs16\c&H606B76&\3c&HCDD3D4&\move(523,207,523,163,0,2982)}All Pizzas
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.45,0:14:46.95,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fnVerdana\shad0\frx8\fry340\c&H70625B&\3c&HAEBCC2&\fs30\pos(274,139)\frz3.142}Welcome.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.47,0:14:56.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.22,0:14:58.34,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Aji-san!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.18,0:15:02.89,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I was actually just about to pay you a visit
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.89,0:15:06.48,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,to bring you this month's rent \Nand pick up your garments.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.48,0:15:11.51,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Gad, no! I can't have you trying \Nto spoil me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.30,0:15:19.11,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,But it must be difficult for you \Nto go up and down all these hills.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.11,0:15:21.38,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Same for you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.38,0:15:24.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.07,0:15:26.02,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, before I forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.24,0:15:31.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,276)\fnTimesNewRoman\an8\shad0\pos(331,138)\c&H575F65&\3c&H93B3C9&}May Rent
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:31.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,1144)\fnTimesNewRoman\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H93B3C9&\pos(162,111)\frz358.8}Kinme Wakana
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.11,0:15:31.99,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(770,268)\fnTimesNewRoman\an8\shad0\c&H575F65&\3c&H93B3C9&\frz358.8\fs16\pos(165,160)}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.67,0:15:30.53,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here's the rent. Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.53,0:15:32.74,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Yup. And thank you too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.26,0:15:37.31,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Time sure flies, doesn't it? \NYou've already been here two years.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.31,0:15:40.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Yes. Thank you for taking such good care of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.69,0:15:42.62,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,I ain't done a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.62,0:15:46.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, a customer brought me some sweets. \NWould you like to stay for tea?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.87,0:15:51.45,Default,Aji,0,0,0,,Oh, really? Don't mind if I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.45,0:15:52.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.28,0:16:13.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's starting to rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.29,0:16:19.84,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The weather was so nice today, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.80,0:16:27.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh... Hello!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.75,0:16:30.55,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.88,0:16:33.93,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, for cleaning?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.56,0:16:39.89,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.89,0:16:43.80,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Ah, right! Please let me check \Nyour garments, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:48.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Would you happen to have a membership card?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.69,0:16:49.67,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,One sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.63,0:16:53.28,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I've got my mother's.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.28,sign_24263_455_Kinme_Cleaning_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(895,1)}Kinme Cleaning
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.28,sign_24263_455_Kinme_Cleaning_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(895,1)\fs14\c&HF3FDEF&\3c&H71AF60&\fnTimesNewRoman\pos(630,48)}We Come to You!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.28,sign_24263_457_Member__183__Nam,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(895,1)\3c&HFFFFFF&\c&H000000&\pos(630,67)\fs12}Member: {\fs18}183
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.95,0:16:53.28,sign_24263_458_Name__Ishimochi_,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(895,1)\pos(630,88)}Name: {\fs18}Ishimochi Kashimi
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.28,0:16:56.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, of course. From Ishimochi-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.59,0:16:59.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Are you running errands for your mother today?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.50,0:17:01.76,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah, she seems kind of busy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.79,0:17:05.21,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Huh. You don't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:13.07,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh. It looks like this has some loose threads.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.07,0:17:15.25,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Would you mind confirming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.25,0:17:16.10,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.73,0:17:20.85,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Uh... what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.35,0:17:23.27,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,N-Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.49,0:17:28.49,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um, is something wro—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.75,0:17:33.56,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.59,0:17:37.00,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Excuse me!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.25,0:17:42.64,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.36,0:17:45.57,Italics,Kyusho (M),0,0,0,,Sandpaper?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.13,0:17:48.88,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Can you tell me how you got this scratch?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.17,0:17:53.04,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Huh? Oh, probably from a concrete wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.04,0:17:54.71,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,You must have scraped it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.16,0:17:56.01,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.29,0:17:58.14,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,This will only take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.61,0:18:00.15,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.27,0:18:04.77,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\b1\pos(319,350)\c&H424248&\3c&HCEE1E2&}Cleaning License Certificate\N Registered in Shizuoka Prefecture - Kinme Wakana
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.40,0:18:29.17,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's just a quick fix, but at least \Nit covered up the scratch a little.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.81,0:18:32.05,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Crazy! But I thought you did laundry!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.05,0:18:37.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Well, yes. But this is still \Na time-honored cleaning technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.61,0:18:40.04,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,After buffing the scratch with sandpaper,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:43.54,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I covered it up with \Na color-correcting polish. And that's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.54,0:18:45.49,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Color-correcting polish...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.93,0:18:50.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,In addition to clothing, \Nof course we can clean shoes here,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.58,0:18:53.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but we also do cloth and leather bags \Nas well as various personal items.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.58,0:18:56.77,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I put my heart and soul \Ninto cleaning anything I'm asked to.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.82,0:19:00.08,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh! I'm so sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.66,0:19:05.03,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It's just, just... the scratch on your shoe \Nbothered me so much...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.03,0:19:08.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and you didn't even ask me to!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.12,0:19:10.59,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Oh, I've gone and done it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.59,0:19:13.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Of course, I won't charge you for that,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.98,0:19:17.36,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and if you aren't satisfied, \NI'll happily reimburse you for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.36,0:19:19.18,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,No, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.98,0:19:25.98,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Here is your receipt.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.98,0:19:26.98,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\shad0\c&H612E2A&\3c&HAAAFAD&\b1\fs16}I washed it but it still isn't clean!\N\N{\3c&H48407D&\c&HAFAEBB&}Well...\N  {\c&H000000&\3c&HBDBFBD&}that's because of a {\c&HB2B9B5&\3c&H34267B&}mismatch\Nbetween the {\c&H872423&\3c&HBDBFBD&}kind of stain\Nand your type of cleaning!\N\N{\c&H696566&\3c&HD4D4D4&}At Kinme Cleaning, we use\Nwashing methods tailored\Nto the exact type of\Ncleaning you need.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.23,0:19:27.95,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.08,0:19:32.58,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,It seems to be raining heavier now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.99,0:19:40.87,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Um, I'm happy to lend you \Nthis umbrella, if you'd like.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.87,0:19:43.12,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I wouldn't want your shoes getting too wet.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.56,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.36,0:19:49.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I hope to see you again soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.04,0:19:55.79,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.91,0:20:01.14,Default,Kyusho,0,0,0,,Do you think you could clean \Nmy school bag for me sometime?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.70,0:20:07.79,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Sure! You can count on Kinme.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.65,0:20:20.23,Italics,Kyusho,0,0,0,,I used to think cleaners \Nwere all basically the same,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.53,0:20:31.04,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\an9\c&H568135&\3c&H81B554&\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman}We Come to You!\N{\fnArial\c&H000000&\3c&HBDBFBD&}Kinme Cleaning\N{\c&H568135&\3c&H81B554&\fnTimesNewRoman}Contact us anytime
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.91,0:20:29.02,Italics,Kyusho,0,0,0,,but I think I'm starting to understand \Nwhy Mom switched to this place recently.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H000000&\3c&HFFFFFF&\pos(105,92)\fs30}Kinme's
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.01,0:22:04.01,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\b1\c&H000000&\fs30\bord0\pos(290,149)}Quick Memo
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.61,0:22:03.50,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Kinme's Quick Memo!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.01,0:22:05.69,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Come on in!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.69,0:22:08.64,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Pleased to meet you. My name is Kinme Wakana.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.02,0:22:15.05,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'd like to share my day-to-day schedule \Nwith you and show you the layout of the shop!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.36,0:22:20.59,sign_32017_516_Kinme_san_s_Usua,text,0,0,0,,Kinme-san's Usual Day\N(Weekday Example)
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.59,0:22:24.38,sign_32143_517_Wake_Up_Jog_,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(15,13)\3c&HEEF59A&}Wake Up\NJog
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.38,0:22:26.47,sign_32143_517_Wake_Up_Jog_,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(15,13)\3c&H95D976&}Shower & Breakfast
Dialogue: 1,0:22:15.36,0:22:19.44,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,My usual day begins with an early-morning jog.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:19.44,0:22:21.39,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I'm really not a morning person,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:21.39,0:22:25.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,but a jog along the ocean with \Nall that beautiful scenery wakes me right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.47,0:22:28.39,sign_32143_517_Wake_Up_Jog_,text,0,0,0,,{\an7\pos(15,13)\3c&H98FABD&}Get Ready to Open
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.39,0:22:33.61,sign_32330_523_Open_Store_Iron_,text,0,0,0,,Open Store\N\NIron clothes left\Nhanging from\Nthe day before\N\NSee customers\N(I get many \Ncustomers in\Nthe morning, \Nso things can\Nget busy)
Dialogue: 1,0:22:25.72,0:22:29.28,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,When I get back, I start \Ngetting ready for the day's work.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:29.28,0:22:32.51,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I usually spend my mornings \Nironing and helping customers.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.61,0:22:39.27,sign_32330_523_Open_Store_Iron_,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&H8CB7F3&}Break Time\N\N Grocery\NShopping\N\NI often buy\Nlunch at the\Nbread shop
Dialogue: 1,0:22:32.51,0:22:36.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,After a lunch break, I see more \Ncustomers, treat stains, wash clothes,
Dialogue: 1,0:22:36.90,0:22:40.56,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,and then dry or hang up the cleaned garments.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:40.56,0:22:42.85,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Between my other tasks, I also make deliveries.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.27,0:22:48.82,sign_32330_523_Open_Store_Iron_,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HA189F1&}Sort collected\Ngarments\N\NTreat stains\Nand run\Nseveral\Nwash loads\N\N Air dry/hang\Nwashed\Ngarments in\Nthe shade\N(from overnight\Nto 2 days)
Dialogue: 1,0:22:42.85,0:22:47.46,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Other cleaners might do their morning \Nand afternoon routines the other way around.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:47.96,0:22:52.16,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,When I'm done with work, \NI go to the hot spring for a relaxing bath.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.82,0:22:54.79,sign_32330_523_Open_Store_Iron_,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HA189F1&}See customers\N(things get\Nsomewhat\Nquieter\Ntoward evening)\N\N Make deliveries\Nbetween \Nother tasks
Dialogue: 1,0:22:52.16,0:22:55.62,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,That can become difficult \Nduring the busy season, though.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:55.62,0:23:00.32,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,And then I go to bed at about 10 PM. \NThat's how I spend my days.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.79,0:22:57.88,sign_32330_523_Open_Store_Iron_,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HF0B5D3&}Close shop\N\N Relax at a\Nnearby\Npublic bath\Nor hot spring\N\NDinner\N\N Balance\Nthe register
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.88,0:23:00.73,sign_32330_523_Open_Store_Iron_,text,0,0,0,,{\3c&HEE979A&}Sleep
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.73,0:23:03.37,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next, I'll show you the layout of the shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.37,0:23:07.30,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,When you walk in, my goldfish, \NPoly-chan, is right there to greet you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.30,0:23:11.94,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,I keep garments that I'm holding \Nfor customers by the counter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.94,0:23:15.72,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,The ironing board is by the window and \NI have a desk for stain removal in the back
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.72,0:23:18.13,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,by the washer and dryer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.13,0:23:21.41,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Go even further back \Nand there's a door to the backyard,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.41,0:23:25.26,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,a staircase going up to the second floor, \Nand even a break room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.26,0:23:30.90,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,So now you know a bit more about my daily \Nschedule and the layout of Kinme Cleaning.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.90,0:23:34.70,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,We at Kinme Cleaning look forward \Nto continue serving you in the future!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.02,0:23:40.02,Default,text,0,0,0,,{\shad0\fnTimesNewRoman\c&H020201&\bord0\pos(330,155)}Episode {\c&H8A80CC&}2{\c&H020201} We're Proud of Our {\c&HA49F43&}Natural {\c&H020201&}Hot Spring
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.92,0:23:39.29,Default,Kinme,0,0,0,,Next time is "We're Proud of \NOur Natural Hot Spring."
